    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Below is a single player survival horror game where you are tasked with repairing and maintaining the equipment in an underground facility to bring it back online and make sure you survive the new ice age. But be careful, as something wants to claim the facility for itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair and Restore</strong> - Restore power to the facility and bring it back to life. Keep all systems operational to make survival easier and to kick out any unwanted guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>- Explore the frozen remnants of an underground facility and look for anything that can aid you in your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive </strong>- Survive the cold by staying in heated rooms or by supplementing your body using questionable chemicals. Furthermore, the environment is not the only thing that is trying to kill you, so be careful as there is something that does not want you in his new home.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Below is a single player survival horror game where you are tasked with repairing and maintaining the equipment in an underground facility to bring it back online and make sure you survive the new ice age. But be careful, as something wants to claim the facility for itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair and Restore</strong> - Restore power to the facility and bring it back to life. Keep all systems operational to make survival easier and to kick out any unwanted guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>- Explore the frozen remnants of an underground facility and look for anything that can aid you in your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive </strong>- Survive the cold by staying in heated rooms or by supplementing your body using questionable chemicals. Furthermore, the environment is not the only thing that is trying to kill you, so be careful as there is something that does not want you in his new home.</p></li></ul>",
